''', ' and ''whole-food ingredients''. The image analysis complements this by showcasing the product''s versatility and ease of use', ' particularly the almond butter. No emotional or problem-based angles are evident', ' focusing instead on the factual', ' beneficial attributes and necessities that cater to the health and nutrition benefits touted in the text."');
