ou use “natural flavors”. Just tell us what the natural flavors are.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_28964503053164905""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about high price and inaccurate serving size claims""', ' ""message"": ""Tried it and It’s great! Just wish I could afford it! $67 for 1.7 lbs is too high.\n\nOnly 20 servings in a bag not 30 like they state.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_478192525284007""}', ' {""theme"": ""Questions the necessity and amount of ingredients affecting taste""', ' ""message"": ""If it tastes so good why are you putting all that other stuff in there? Also ...how can you know how it tastes with all the stuff you have in there?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_542773601752985""}', ' {""theme"": ""Concern over misleading product claims; states preference for whey due to scientific benefits""', ' ""message"": ""Whey is actually better based on science.  High in leucine and rapid digestion and absorption. Beef is great too', ' but don''t spread lies just to sell your product.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_703020368718054""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises nutritional value of hot beef injections""', ' ""message"": ""Hot beef injections are very nutritious""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_984794250387131""}', ' {""theme"": ""Discusses the benefits of whey protein isolate for those who cannot tolerate meat proteins""', ' ""message"": ""Of dairy products whey protein isolate is the most readily absorbed.  Because believe it or not there are those of us that do not tolerate meat proteins.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_2853624998151199""}', ' {""theme"": ""Dislikes the use of stevia in the product""', ' ""message"": ""You had me until I saw stevia.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051