"', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_8950123735085762""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests recipe for brownies featured in the ad""', ' ""message"": ""Does someone have the recipe for the brownies in the add? It’s not in the recipe book""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_920632043221353""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about high price""', ' ""message"": ""It so expensive""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1539843073380599""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about excess lead content study mentioned""', ' ""message"": ""Are you in the 47% in this recnet study with too much lead? https://www.amazon.com/Cortizone-10-Intensive-Anti-Itch-Hydrocortisone/dp/B0CMVJFWX7?th=1""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_615081784603759""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about product not mixing well""', ' ""message"": ""Just got the unflavored. It doesn’t mix well at all. Remains very clumpy""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1394910418406120""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquiry about mixing options for a product""', ' ""message"": ""What do you mix it with?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_631776299314926""}', ' {""theme"": ""Dissatisfaction with product texture and usability""', ' ""message"": ""I was so excited to try this from all the raving reviews and was dissatisfied. No matter what I did', ' it either clumped', ' got really sticky and was just overall not good. I sold an opened bag and have one that is almost gone. I am forcing myself to use it because I already spent the money.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1682488665992022""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about gluten-free status of the product""', ' ""message"": ""Is it gluten free?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_908881073944807""}', ' {""theme"": ""Customer requests nutritional information on the label for vanilla product""', ' ""message"": ""It won''t let me see the label for vanilla.  I click on it', ' but nothing happens.\nCan you tell me the fat and cholesterol amounts please? Or better yet', ' screenshot the label ?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1749541445823102""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about product not mixing well""', ' ""message"": ""It does not mix well in a shaker cup""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_896081942351216""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asks about product ingredients due to coconut allergy""', ' ""message"": ""Does it have coconut', ' mct oil? I''m allergic to coconut anything.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_4002838600005152""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praised the product for being the best and requested more sugar-free flavors""', ' ""message"": ""🙌🏻 The best & only protein I use! Please create more flavors (definitely without sugar)!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_548381810859306""}', ' {""theme"": ""Seeks clarification on the lead problem related to the product""', ' ""message"": ""I just received mine but didn’t know about the lead problem. Can you explain what this is about?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1015134136875749""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes the health impact and nutritional effectiveness of BCAAs and protein powders""', ' ""message"": ""Protein powder\n\nBCAA''s and Protein Powder\n\nFirst', ' no natural \""products\"" or versions of powdered', ' supplemental BCAA''s (branched-chain amino acids) or protein powders exist.\n\nTo make them', ' the proteins and amino acids have to be chemically rendered and heated at least; many are processed much more. \n\nThis process denatures and fragments the proteins and amino acids', ' changing how they are absorbed and the metabolic/hormonal reaction they cause in the body compared to a natural whole-food-sourced protein.\n\nBoth protein powders and BCAA''s dramatically raise insulin compared to natural protein', ' some more than table sugar. \n\nBCAA''s have been associated with insulin resistance and metabolic syndrome directly. And that result was testing natural BCAA''s', ' isolated commercialized versions have a more profound effect still.\n\nDenatured proteins strongly stimulate insulin', ' have an increased Mtor (protein regulation pathway) and incretin (insulin priming) effect', ' and are more easily glycated. \n\nEach of these has independently been shown to turn off our long-lived genes', ' speed up the aging process', ' and promote degenerative diseases. \n\nImagine what happens when all four of those actions are activated at once!\n\nI know the gym lore stating that we have all heard the hype that BCAAs shuttle amino acids into the cells', ' insulin is anabolic and \""builds\"" muscle', ' you need \""X\"" amount of protein to grow', ' etc. \n\nBut when you look at it', ' take a step back. Things are NOT what they seem. \n\nRepair (think gym gains) is very different from growth (think body fat... and worse)', ' and in the big picture', ' these \""techniques\"" might do more harm than good.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1262166051505761""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests a brownie recipe without peanut butter""', ' ""message"": ""Do you have a brownie recipe without peanut butter???""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_578804928123386""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises chocolate and vanilla flavors', ' highlighting the lack of stevia aftertaste""', ' ""message"": ""This stuff is DELISH!! I’ve always been a chocolate fan and this one truly tastes like chocolate cake. But I tried the vanilla today and OMG! I might like it better than the chocolate. I’ve also always hated the aftertaste with stevia. Not even noticeable in this. I’m hooked.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1564896437469606""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests recipe for Brownies""', ' ""message"": ""Does anyone have the recipe for the Brownies?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_616216924245352""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises product''s effectiveness and taste""', ' ""message"": ""Tried it for the first time my stomach remained flat. The taste was delicious.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_990151416351737""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests removal of synthetic ''natural flavoring'' from products""', ' ""message"": ""Please get rid of “NATURAL FLAVORING”. It’s not natural. It’s synthetic.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1885651398951039""}', ' {""theme"": ""Enjoys adding flavored products and collagen powder to coffee for protein boost""', ' ""message"": ""I love the Salted Caramel', ' Chocolate', ' Vanilla and Peanut Butter. I add a scoop into my cold brew ', ' along with a scoop of your unflavored Collagen Peptide powder. I pulse it in the blender and pour it over ice. Great way to enjoy my coffee and get some protein! Win! Win!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1526910104661897""}', ' {""theme"": ""Excitement about making a purchase""', ' ""message"": ""Just ordered !""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_595393796536335""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests for recipes""', ' ""message"": ""Sure would like some recipes.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1677019662909086""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises taste but highlights issue with clumping""', ' ""message"": ""Tastes great but getting a lot of clumps…. Any suggestions?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1736440733598715""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests recipe for brownies""', ' ""message"": ""Recipe for the brownies?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1774655396603392""}', ' {""theme"": ""Concern about strong beef flavor and smell in unflavored product""', ' ""message"": ""How do you get past the STRONG beef flavor/smell in the unflavored""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_581480807946010""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises brownies recipe for being pleasing""', ' ""message"": ""Brownies recipe pleases""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1065532578540131""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires if protein powders are dairy-free""', ' ""message"": ""@equip are your protein powders dairy free?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_645914108109084""}', ' {""theme"": ""Confusion about product performance and possible misuse""', ' ""message"": ""Mixed it in my blend jet and it just jelled? Real oiling on my lips and mouth. Is there something I did wrong?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_972534858200868""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses concern over allergen cross-contamination""', ' ""message"": ""Allergen statement says shared lines with peanuts', ' soy etc.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_905679198046205""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asks for advice on balancing arginine and lysine ratios""', ' ""message"": ""What can I do to balance out the argenine and lysine amino acids to be equal. I can’t have that much argenine… if I do the lysine ratio needs to be as high or higher .. any suggestions …""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_684273040762502""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests unsweetened flavored protein options""', ' ""message"": ""I only like the unflavored protein i wish you guy can make flavor protein but unsweetened. By the e way this is the only protein that does not bloated me""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": "