action with the experience or product""', ' ""message"": ""Disgusting""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_696310419525947""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises product''s ability to make amazing pudding""', ' ""message"": ""Makes amazing pudding too!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_574573435559705""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expressions of amusement or surprise""', ' ""message"": ""The balloon pop lol""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1205164104679104""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about stock availability of Cinnamon bun""', ' ""message"": ""When do you think you will have Cinnamon bun back in stock 😭😭😭😭""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1486796158683970""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about the strawberry flavor being too salty""', ' ""message"": ""The strawberry flavor is too salty I was soo excited to try this product but it''s just waaayyyy tooo salty I wish it wasn''t soo or atleast hoped the customers were more honest with their review otherwise I would''ve gotten a different flavor....""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1201474995321266""}', ' {""theme"": ""Displeased with the use of coconut milk in vanilla product""', ' ""message"": ""The vanilla does have coconut milk which bothers me""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1285855536394619""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about hormone use in cow-derived products""', ' ""message"": ""Is this from hormone free cows?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_795012996179829""}', ' {""theme"": ""Questions the compatibility of being sugar-free with gut health claims""', ' ""message"": ""How do you advertise as “everything your gut needs for comfort health” but then it’s sugar free? \n\nSide effects of stevia can include stomach pain', ' gas', ' constipation', ' etc.""', ' ""sent