late protein powders! I love adding them to my coffee in the morning. I also add in the unflavored collagen to my coffee. \n\nI love making my protein shakes with both the chocolate protein and unflavored collagen!! Quick and easy.  \n\nI got a free raspberry colostrum gummy bag during a promo you had going', ' and I LOVE those too! \n\nI do wish you had the flavored options without the stevia', ' no sweeteners added at all would be ideal for me. But 100% happy with all products I’ve had so far!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_638712669085100""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises the use of coconut cream for a richer', ' smoother texture in ice cream""', ' ""message"": ""My ice cream recipe:\n2 scoop Equip Prime Protein powder \n(I like strawberry or carmel best)\n1 - 13.5 oz can coconut CREAM\nWater to the FILL LINE of my Largest NutriBullet cup.\nExtract & sweetener to taste. I prefer liquid Allulose or Stevia. \n\nBlend.\n\nPour into Cuisinart ice cream maker and run until thick and creamy ice cream 🍦 😋 \n\nI think the coconut cream makes it even richer and smoother than dairy.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_649051394477502""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about product ingredient', ' casein""', ' ""message"": ""Does it contain casein?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_960552139229223""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes overpowering stevia aftertaste""', ' ""message"": ""The thought the stevia aftertaste was overpowering.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_517208234702133""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asks about product manufacturing location""', ' ""message"": ""Where is it MANUFACTURED?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1035105398650141""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about presence of stevia in many protein powders""', ' ""message"": ""I’m allergic to stevia and it’s in sooooo many protein po