  Usually 4-5 ingredients.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_942459947818648""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the ingredients in natural flavors""', ' ""message"": ""Equip Can you clarify what is in your natural flavors', ' please?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1791149561716804""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests tips for mixing protein shake to avoid clumps""', ' ""message"": ""Tips for mixing? I know clumps are normal', ' but I feel like my cup gets more protein from it sticking than I do 🤣. I use an immersion mixer.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_969342315255191""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about recipe availability""', ' ""message"": ""Just received our first order.  Is their recipes?  First time trying it.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_367825473054087""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about high price""', ' ""message"": ""To expensive""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_3318035735159077""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about high price""', ' ""message"": ""Expensive 🫰 tho""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_851259556989809""}', ' {""theme"": ""Mixed feedback on chocolate flavor and texture over time""', ' ""message"": ""Chocolate flavor is good.  If you leave it for too long in your cup', ' it turns gelatinous.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_987479746452097""}', ' {""theme"": ""Seeks advice on reducing beef taste""', ' ""message"": ""How do I cut down the beef taste? I really want to keep trying this.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1950232222173296""}', ' {""theme"": ""Questions the need for natural flavoring in products""', ' ""message"": ""Why do you need natural flavoring?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_8915876