ment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_2040165076426337""}', ' {""theme"": ""Appreciates lack of additives; inquires about strawberry flavor""', ' ""message"": ""To the people complaining about clumping and difficulty mixing - it''s a good thing because it means they''re not adding other crap like sunflower lecithin to make it smoother. I''m going to order soon hope I like it.. I''ve been trying to find something that doesn''t have a lot of gunk in it for a while. Does anyone have opinions on the strawberry one?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1559699891604885""}', ' {""theme"": ""Concerns about the use of ''Natural Flavors'' in the product''s ingredients""', ' ""message"": ""I was going to buy the protein powder until I read the ingredients....*Natural Flavors* 😐""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_514898081538528""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asks about availability of pre-made shakes""', ' ""message"": ""Do you have already made shakes?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_493411450405515""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes marketing of plant-based meat alternatives""', ' ""message"": ""BEYOND STUPID .. just eat the meat... Unbelievable people buy The Marketing of BULLSHIT""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_988675123285241""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises protein product for enhancing homemade ice cream""', ' ""message"": ""The best protein! Makes the yummiest ice cream in my Ninja Creami!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1266866884744908""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about taste and smell of product""', ' ""message"": ""It taste and smells like beef. Makes me gag.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1726072931322720""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses strong personal preference for the product""', ' ""message"": ""My favorite!!!""', ' ""s