, ' healthy food habits', ' I used this stuff. Results are 60 lbs and muscle definition I’ve never seen in my body. It’s the combination of things', ' often little things like enjoying your morning coffee with delicious extra protein boost what helps you along the way.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_530177049566576""}', ' {""theme"": ""Mention or tagging of another individual""', ' ""message"": ""Jordan Ann Weaver🤔""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1302771917673546""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses love for the product and inquires about a recipe""', ' ""message"": ""Love this protein powder where do I find the recipe for those brownies""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_934659278545658""}', ' {""theme"": ""Appreciates vanilla flavor but criticizes or questions the image used in advertising""', ' ""message"": ""I love the vanilla', ' but that thumbnail! 🤔😆""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_814087490610436""}', ' {""theme"": ""Questions the lack of B12 information on unflavored product""', ' ""message"": ""Why the unflavored one doesn’t show B12 % ?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_596730019657363""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises product versatility and family appeal""', ' ""message"": ""Our families favorite protein!! Between the 8 of us at home there are many smoothies being made each day. My kids love mixing the proteins. Their favorites chocolate/coffee', ' chocolate/strawberry', ' coffee/chocolate/peanut butter. They use raw milk or coconut cream with water. Also 1/2 an avocado to get more good fats. My husband loves to add a scoop to plain Greek yogurt for extra protein. Thanks for this awesome product.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_962295738676855""}', ' {""theme"": ""Concerns about the ambiguity and transparency of ''natural flavors