wder \n(I like strawberry or carmel best)\n1 - 13.5 oz can coconut CREAM\nWater to the FILL LINE of my Largest NutriBullet cup.\nExtract & sweetener to taste. I prefer liquid Allulose or Stevia. \n\nBlend.\n\nPour into Cuisinart ice cream maker and run until thick and creamy ice cream 🍦 😋 \n\nI think the coconut cream makes it even richer and smoother than dairy.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_649051394477502""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about product ingredient', ' casein""', ' ""message"": ""Does it contain casein?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_960552139229223""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes overpowering stevia aftertaste""', ' ""message"": ""The thought the stevia aftertaste was overpowering.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_517208234702133""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asks about product manufacturing location""', ' ""message"": ""Where is it MANUFACTURED?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1035105398650141""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about presence of stevia in many protein powders""', ' ""message"": ""I’m allergic to stevia and it’s in sooooo many protein powders:(""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_526141710012706""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about availability of sample sizes""', ' ""message"": ""Do you have sample sizes to try?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_2534784773539775""}', ' {""theme"": ""Request to exchange chocolate flavor for vanilla""', ' ""message"": ""I''ve tried 2 times to like the chocolate bc it is so clean. I just can''t make it work for me. Can I swap it for vanilla or am I SOL?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1188242286053660""}', ' {""theme"": ""Anticipates trying Maria Emmerich recommended product with satisfaction guarantee""', ' ""message"": ""I ordered this one 