 Bonneau do you see the doppelgänger I see?? 👀 Scares the crap out of me every time this ad pops up""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1770690883734325""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-10-25T19:29:32.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquiry about lactose-free product availability""', ' ""message"": ""Lactose free?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_472219082454794""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-09-01T15:58:50.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises the taste of multiple coffee flavors""', ' ""message"": ""Love this! I’ve tried the iced coffee', ' vanilla', ' chocolate and salted caramel and they all taste amazing. Highly recommend!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_607417475388944""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-01-28T23:20:15.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises chocolate and vanilla flavors; inquires about the taste of strawberry""', ' ""message"": ""I love the chocolate and vanilla. I am curious how the strawberry one tastes.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1274532457245649""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-09-18T13:00:32.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests recipe details featured in the image""', ' ""message"": ""Where is the recipe for what''s in the pic?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_2227128781014380""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-02-11T04:16:59.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the product''s amino acid profile""', ' ""message"": ""Does this have a full amino acid profile ?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1097938631740073""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-11-13T00:53:28.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests the recipe for brownies""', ' ""message"": ""What’s recipe for brownies""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_871299761773599""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-10-01T00:46:25.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about product effectiveness for midsection weight loss""', ' ""message"": ""Does this help with midsection weight loss? I''ve got 10-15lbs I just can''t get rid of!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_2150694602019021""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-03-31T01:03:35.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the return of the cinnamon roll flavor""', ' ""message"": ""Is the cinnamon roll flavor coming back soon? I''m dying to try it!!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1011856654295431""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-01-24T03:55:25.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about product being organic""', ' ""message"": ""Organic?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1444393592922277""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-09-17T07:25:22.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests clear ingredient listing and recommends making a homemade protein shake with specific ingredients.""', ' ""message"": ""Where’s the ingredient list? \nMake your own protein shake', ' save your money. \n\nProtein shake recipe:\nNaked Egg white protein powder (half serving)\nTotal carnivore steak shake no flavor protein powder (half serving)\nNaked peanut butter powder (full serving)\nCocao powder (full serving)\nGlutamine (full serving)\nNaked beef collagen (full serving)\n\n41.5g of protein \nNO FILLERS', ' NO ARTIFICIAL OR NATURAL FLAVORS', ' and NO SUGARS (artificial or natural). \n\nYou’re welcome""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1071419068001252""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-01-07T15:34:13.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asking about the taste of the unflavored product""', ' ""message"": ""How’s the taste of the unflavored one?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_2581227002267560""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-01-20T07:09:07.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about recipe for brownies featured in the ad""', ' ""message"": ""Do you have the recipe for the brownies that are in the add?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1150796409322599""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-09-11T16:18:14.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests the availability of product samples to try before purchasing""', ' ""message"": ""Can place I can buy samples.  I’m so tired of purchasing containers that people loved and I can’t choke down?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_998889905610892""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-10-17T20:35:40.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests a sampler pack with all flavors""', ' ""message"": ""Please make a sampler with all of your flavors!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_976326313894743""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-02-05T03:24:42.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Request to remove ''natural flavors'' from product""', ' ""message"": ""Get rid of the \""natural flavors\"" and I''ll give it a shot!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1197178744743970""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-07-31T21:05:36.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Considering purchase""', ' ""message"": ""I’m thinking about getting it""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1216934503112416""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-13T17:05:04.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asks about NSF endorsement for athletes""', ' ""message"": ""Is this endorsed by NSF for athletes""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_945680806968847""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-11-24T13:07:58.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about high shipping cost""', ' ""message"": ""Was going to buy until I saw the $7 charge for shipping 🥴""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_28798429129772756""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-03-18T21:57:07.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about a recipe link for brownies""', ' ""message"": ""Is there a recipe link for these brownies?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_955798046641594""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-02-24T17:10:36.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Likes protein and collagen powders; requests flavored options without sweeteners""', ' ""message"": ""I love the unflavored and chocolate protein powders! I love adding them to my coffee in the morning. I also add in the unflavored collagen to my coffee. \n\nI love making my protein shakes with both the chocolate protein and unflavored collagen!! Quick and easy.  \n\nI got a free raspberry colostrum gummy bag during a promo you had going', ' and I LOVE those too! \n\nI do wish you had the flavored options without the stevia', ' no sweeteners added at all would be ideal for me. But 100% happy with all products I’ve had so far!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_638712669085100""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-03-27T14:56:11.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises the use of coconut cream for a richer', ' smoother texture in ice cream""', ' ""message"": ""My ice cream recipe:\n2 scoop Equip Prime Protein powder \n(I like strawberry or carmel best)\n1 - 13.5 oz can coconut CREAM\nWater to the FILL LINE of my Largest NutriBullet cup.\nExtract & sweetener to taste. I prefer liquid Allulose or Stevia. \n\nBlend.\n\nPour into Cuisinart ice cream maker and run until thick and creamy ice cream 🍦 😋 \n\nI think the coconut cream makes it even richer and smoother than dairy.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_649051394477502""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-02-27T18:35:12.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about product ingredient', ' casein""', ' ""message"": ""Does it contain casein?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_960552139229223""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-11-17T03:44:53.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes overpowering stevia aftertaste""', ' ""message"": ""The thought the stevia aftertaste was overpower