kest parts of your body', ' causing damage and pain. It takes years for them to build up inside you... and many more years to detox from them. Believe me', ' I know. I used to eat all those ingredients daily', ' until it caught up. \n\nNot to mention', ' as a T2 diabetic', ' these brownies are way too many carbs.\n\nBut', ' hey', ' to each their own. \nEnjoy...\n   While you can.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_653824107262329""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-13T03:53:15.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the specific recipe""', ' ""message"": ""What is the recipe?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1218299946082135""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-03T00:53:24.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests content for low carb video""', ' ""message"": ""I  was hoping for a low carb video.  Hopes dashed""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_686107190450387""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-15T01:58:55.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses satisfaction with product quality""', ' ""message"": ""Made these and they were solid.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1739756000226853""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-06T04:21:50.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Concern about the health impact of natural sugars""', ' ""message"": ""That''s a lot of maple syrup.  It''s a still sugar even if it is natural.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1371168453809868""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-03-27T20:56:30.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about adverse reaction to stevia""', ' ""message"": ""No way the stevia', '  in it is horrible', ' had a headache for days""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_874770244775916""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-11T22:10:16.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Defends recipe as an occasional', ' simple alternative to complex baking mixes""', ' ""mess