""message"": ""I have it every morning for breakfast with a bunch of butter', ' raw egg and hot coffee', ' blend it up and it''s wonderful. Add cinnamon and it tastes like a mexi mocha.  Another thing I do is blend it with cottage cheese and full fat plain Greek yogurt and pour it into popsicle molds. You can add zero carb sweetener like allulose if you like. In the summer you can blend vanilla or strawberry with some fruit and yogurt and cottage cheese. A nice high protein', ' creamy popsicle! Sometimes I add decaf instant coffee with the chocolate. Just use your imagination.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_948383540504973""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-11-23T18:11:49.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests more information about product availability or presence""', ' ""message"": ""Where’s the Beef""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_880644893992339""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-09-16T21:24:55.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about chocolate flavor""', ' ""message"": ""I got a bag of chocolate and can’t stomach the flavor.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_2515286928803358""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-05T16:57:35.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Excited to try new chocolate product; dissatisfied with taste of current whey isolate""', ' ""message"": ""I can''t wait to get my first bag of chocolate. \nMy body isn''t actually liking the whey isolate one I bought a couple days ago. It tastes good', ' but I can''t imagine using it every day.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1018653560165231""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-09T23:51:05.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises product for variety and suitability for low carb diets""', ' ""message"": ""Got 4 flavors. It''s great . It''s great for low carb""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_608346171918902""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-02-06