e for the brownies that are in the add?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1150796409322599""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-09-11T16:18:14.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests the availability of product samples to try before purchasing""', ' ""message"": ""Can place I can buy samples.  I’m so tired of purchasing containers that people loved and I can’t choke down?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_998889905610892""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-10-17T20:35:40.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests a sampler pack with all flavors""', ' ""message"": ""Please make a sampler with all of your flavors!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_976326313894743""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-02-05T03:24:42.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Request to remove ''natural flavors'' from product""', ' ""message"": ""Get rid of the \""natural flavors\"" and I''ll give it a shot!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1197178744743970""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-07-31T21:05:36.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Considering purchase""', ' ""message"": ""I’m thinking about getting it""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1216934503112416""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-13T17:05:04.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asks about NSF endorsement for athletes""', ' ""message"": ""Is this endorsed by NSF for athletes""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_945680806968847""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-11-24T13:07:58.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about high shipping cost""', ' ""message"": ""Was going to buy until I saw the $7 charge for shipping 🥴""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_28798429129772756""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-03-18T21:57:07.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about a recipe link for brownies""', ' ""message"": ""Is there a recipe link for these brownies?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_955798046641594""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-02-24T17:10:36.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Likes protein and collagen powders; requests flavored options without sweeteners""', ' ""message"": ""I love the unflavored and chocolate protein powders! I love adding them to my coffee in the morning. I also add in the unflavored collagen to my coffee. \n\nI love making my protein shakes with both the chocolate protein and unflavored collagen!! Quick and easy.  \n\nI got a free raspberry colostrum gummy bag during a promo you had going', ' and I LOVE those too! \n\nI do wish you had the flavored options without the stevia', ' no sweeteners added at all would be ideal for me. But 100% happy with all products I’ve had so far!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_638712669085100""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-03-27T14:56:11.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises the use of coconut cream for a richer', ' smoother texture in ice cream""', ' ""message"": ""My ice cream recipe:\n2 scoop Equip Prime Protein powder \n(I like strawberry or carmel best)\n1 - 13.5 oz can coconut CREAM\nWater to the FILL LINE of my Largest NutriBullet cup.\nExtract & sweetener to taste. I prefer liquid Allulose or Stevia. \n\nBlend.\n\nPour into Cuisinart ice cream maker and run until thick and creamy ice cream 🍦 😋 \n\nI think the coconut cream makes it even richer and smoother than dairy.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_649051394477502""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-02-27T18:35:12.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about product ingredient', ' casein""', ' ""message"": ""Does it contain casein?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_960552139229223""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-11-17T03:44:53.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes overpowering stevia aftertaste""', ' ""message"": ""The thought the stevia aftertaste was overpower