cipe ?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1189341862593908""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests information or clarification about equipping a recipe""', ' ""message"": ""Equip recipe??""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_969202405403147""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises the protein powder but requests lower carb recipes for brownies""', ' ""message"": ""Love this protein powder but wish you''d give us some lower carb recipes for a brownie 😊""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_2275211052916882""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses enjoyment or satisfaction with the product""', ' ""message"": ""Mmmm👍♥️""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1391311788538340""}', ' {""theme"": ""Dislikes oxalates in products""', ' ""message"": ""Oxalates nope!!!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_565706385823855""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the availability of a recipe""', ' ""message"": ""Recipe?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_9105401379589482""}', ' {""theme"": ""Innovative use of protein powder in savory recipes""', ' ""message"": ""I don''t eat sweet stuff', ' so I have been trying different ideas with my equip protein', ' since it seems all the recipes I come across are catered to sweets . So far', ' I have found it is good as a batter on fish and I make a casserole with eggs', 'cottage cheese', 'protein powder', 'and butter and it comes out so good. It tastes like meat is in the casserole and everyone always asks what kind of seasoning is in it and I tell them just salt and pepper.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_539775275578024""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes use of high oxalate and sugary ingredients in product""', ' ""message"": ""He took a fantastic product and doctored it up with a bunch of garbage ingredients. Maple syrup is not magical... it''s still sugar. Almond butter is super high oxalate/unhealthy. Sweet potatoes are also very high oxalate so you''re getting a double whammy of kidney stone material. Add in the cinnamon for ANOTHER high oxalate ingredient. Chocolate is ALSO in the high oxalate group. Yikes!! \n\nOxalates aren''t only the foundation for kidney stones', ' they are a toxin that can settle into your weakest parts of your body', ' causing damage and pain. It takes years for them to build up inside you... and many more years to detox from them. Believe me', ' I know. I used to eat all those ingredients daily', ' until it caught up. \n\nNot to mention', ' as a T2 diabetic', ' these brownies are way too many carbs.\n\nBut', ' hey', ' to each their own. \nEnjoy...\n   While you can.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_653824107262329""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the specific recipe""', ' ""message"": ""What is the recipe?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1218299946082135""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests content for low carb video""', ' ""message"": ""I  was hoping for a low carb video.  Hopes dashed""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_686107190450387""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses satisfaction with product quality""', ' ""message"": ""Made these and they were solid.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1739756000226853""}', ' {""theme"": ""Concern about the health impact of natural sugars""', ' ""message"": ""That''s a lot of maple syrup.  It''s a still sugar even if it is natural.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1371168453809868""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about adverse reaction to stevia""', ' ""message"": ""No way the stevia', '  in it is horrible', ' had a headache for days""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_874770244775916""}', ' {""theme"": ""Defends recipe as an occasional', ' simple alternative to complex baking mixes""', ' ""message"": ""The comments about oxalates are hysterical.  \n\nIf you’re eating the entire pan', ' every day', ' for days on end', ' maybe it’s an issue.\n\nBut a brownie or two from this recipe', ' once in a while', ' as an alternative to baking mix brownies with a bazillion ingredients is a win for the majority of the population.\n\nTake a chill', ' and don’t have heart failure over a recipe .  Don’t like it?  Don’t make them.  FFS.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_651229597666054""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses satisfaction in owning both products""', ' ""message"": ""And I have both. 😁""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_2153393148498303""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about the health impact of using sweet potato to spike insulin""', ' ""message"": ""You''re completely missing the issue. Spiking our insulin with a sweet potato is a horribly unhealthy thing to do.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_2130241014088203""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about product taste""', ' ""message"": ""Has anyone tried this—does it take good?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1199606538405734""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about one-time promotional offers""', ' ""message"": ""Any specials with a one time offer?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1762028144344386""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses excitement or surprise""', ' ""message"": ""Crystal Burgess ooooo!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_560413723733996""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complaint about use of Stevia""', ' ""message"": ""I would try it if it didn''t have Stevia in it.  🤮""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1801979413707391""}', ' {""theme"": ""Changed opinion to appreciate 