ing to try it!!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1011856654295431""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about product being organic""', ' ""message"": ""Organic?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1444393592922277""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests clear ingredient listing and recommends making a homemade protein shake with specific ingredients.""', ' ""message"": ""Where’s the ingredient list? \nMake your own protein shake', ' save your money. \n\nProtein shake recipe:\nNaked Egg white protein powder (half serving)\nTotal carnivore steak shake no flavor protein powder (half serving)\nNaked peanut butter powder (full serving)\nCocao powder (full serving)\nGlutamine (full serving)\nNaked beef collagen (full serving)\n\n41.5g of protein \nNO FILLERS', ' NO ARTIFICIAL OR NATURAL FLAVORS', ' and NO SUGARS (artificial or natural). \n\nYou’re welcome""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1071419068001252""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asking about the taste of the unflavored product""', ' ""message"": ""How’s the taste of the unflavored one?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_2581227002267560""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about recipe for brownies featured in the ad""', ' ""message"": ""Do you have the recipe for the brownies that are in the add?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1150796409322599""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests the availability of product samples to try before purchasing""', ' ""message"": ""Can place I can buy samples.  I’m so tired of purchasing containers that people loved and I can’t choke down?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_998889905610892""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests a sampler pack with all flavors""', ' ""message"": ""Please make a sampler with all of your flavors!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_9763263138