ng reoccurring shingles prevents me from using this because bone broth', 'collagen and all the other stuff feeds the virus causing it inflame. Pure meat is ok but not the byproducts. Being a carnivore and having shingles and bone loss puts me beta rock and a hard place. I need the extra protein and it’s hard for me to eat sooo much meat', ' but I’m going to do the extra meat strategy. Shingles are cleared thankfully and I want to keep it like that. I’m only posting in case anyone else has shingles or any herpes virus for that matter. There are 10 types of the virus.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_669604595616191""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-25T17:36:07.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes collagen for being ineffective for muscle building""', ' ""message"": ""This is collagen not muscle protein.   Collagen is very poor for building muscle due to lack of necessary essential amino acids.  Collagen is jello without sugar.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1383032996071398""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-06T20:23:16.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about low protein content""', ' ""message"": ""Junk protein', ' only 74% protein per serving.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_687351190364253""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-09T17:04:36.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes the inclusion of dairy in protein powder""', ' ""message"": ""Dairy does Not belong in protein powder. Dairy has over 25 other hidden names too. \nI use Anthony''s grass-fed.\nDairy kept me sick in many ways.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_678857507977130""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-04T13:43:27.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes taste of the product""', ' ""message"": ""If this crap tastes like desert I would hate to taste dinner!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1696261301291817""', ' "