-25T21:43:35.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about high price and inaccurate serving size claims""', ' ""message"": ""Tried it and It’s great! Just wish I could afford it! $67 for 1.7 lbs is too high.\n\nOnly 20 servings in a bag not 30 like they state.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_478192525284007""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-10T19:12:30.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Questions the necessity and amount of ingredients affecting taste""', ' ""message"": ""If it tastes so good why are you putting all that other stuff in there? Also ...how can you know how it tastes with all the stuff you have in there?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_542773601752985""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-03-31T10:27:36.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Concern over misleading product claims; states preference for whey due to scientific benefits""', ' ""message"": ""Whey is actually better based on science.  High in leucine and rapid digestion and absorption. Beef is great too', ' but don''t spread lies just to sell your product.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_703020368718054""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-09T00:44:47.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises nutritional value of hot beef injections""', ' ""message"": ""Hot beef injections are very nutritious""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_984794250387131""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-13T10:22:43.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Discusses the benefits of whey protein isolate for those who cannot tolerate meat proteins""', ' ""message"": ""Of dairy products whey protein isolate is the most readily absorbed.  Because believe it or not there are those of us that do not tolerate meat proteins.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_2853624998151199""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-03-30T17:40:46.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Dislikes the use of stevia in the product""', ' ""message"": ""You had me until I saw stevia.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_2123713838081797""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-06T14:27:25.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes use of stevia in product""', ' ""message"": ""Wish it didn’t use stevia""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1186551653017279""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-06T11:30:54.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes product quality""', ' ""message"": ""Because you had poor quality whey.... bullshit post.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_2808219529360784""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-03-30T18:06:31.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticism of claims made by influential bodybuilders""', ' ""message"": ""Interesting how all the big bodybuilders with proven results will disagree.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1208290910857433""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-03-27T19:41:51.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses a dismissive or negative reaction""', ' ""message"": ""Shut up.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_688550123608948""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-04-11T23:29:21.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Concerns about bone broth and collagen impacting shingles condition""', ' ""message"": ""I was curious about isolates so I looked it up. All the fat and some other stuff has been removed but I discovered that the bone is used along with other stuff. I was hoping it was fully meat. Having reoccurring shingles prevents me from using this because bone broth', 'collagen and all the other stuff feeds the virus causing it inflame. Pure meat is ok but not the byproducts. Being a carnivore and having shingles and bone loss puts me beta rock and a hard place. I need the extra protein and it’s hard for me to eat sooo much meat', ' but I’m going to do the extra meat strategy. Shingles are cleared thankfully and I want to keep it like