so very high oxalate so you''re getting a double whammy of kidney stone material. Add in the cinnamon for ANOTHER high oxalate ingredient. Chocolate is ALSO in the high oxalate group. Yikes!! \n\nOxalates aren''t only the foundation for kidney stones', ' they are a toxin that can settle into your weakest parts of your body', ' causing damage and pain. It takes years for them to build up inside you... and many more years to detox from them. Believe me', ' I know. I used to eat all those ingredients daily', ' until it caught up. \n\nNot to mention', ' as a T2 diabetic', ' these brownies are way too many carbs.\n\nBut', ' hey', ' to each their own. \nEnjoy...\n   While you can.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_653824107262329""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the specific recipe""', ' ""message"": ""What is the recipe?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1218299946082135""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests content for low carb video""', ' ""message"": ""I  was hoping for a low carb video.  Hopes dashed""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_686107190450387""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses satisfaction with product quality""', ' ""message"": ""Made these and they were solid.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1739756000226853""}', ' {""theme"": ""Concern about the health impact of natural sugars""', ' ""message"": ""That''s a lot of maple syrup.  It''s a still sugar even if it is natural.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1371168453809868""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about adverse reaction to stevia""', ' ""message"": ""No way the stevia', '  in it is horrible', ' had a headache for days""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_874770244775916""}', ' {""theme"": ""Defends recipe as an occasional', ' simple alternative to complex baking mixes""', ' ""message""