of steak per serving. ❌ No bloating', ' discomfort', ' or acne often associated with whey. 🏆 Free from dairy', ' chemicals', ' fillers', ' binding agents', ' artificial coloring and sweeteners. ✅ Perfect for those adhering to a paleo diet. 📈 Higher in essential amino acids and collagen.""', ' ""ad_title"": ""Subscribe for 15% OFF!""', ' ""comments"": [{""theme"": ""Inquires about the presence of coffee in iced coffee""', ' ""message"": ""Does your iced coffee actually have coffee in it?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1361174585122429""}', ' {""theme"": ""Promotes balanced perspective on using different protein sources""', ' ""message"": ""I wish people would stop bashing one or the other. They are both extremely useful. It’s just depends on what you need them for and when you need them', ' it is always beneficial at times to change your source of protein to help your body absorb more protein so stop bashing all the time they’re both fantastic just in different ways at different times. ￼""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1186544216496055""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes the effectiveness of whey in comparison to other options""', ' ""message"": ""Whey has the same bioavailability. So no', ' it’s not better.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1343768410190499""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses skepticism about bananas in smoothies due to PPO blocking flavanol absorption""', ' ""message"": ""Idk why people put bananas in smoothies…\nPPO blocks the absorption of flavanols.  Funny to see this on something preaching about nutrition… makes me wonder""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1148452987059504""}', ' {""theme"": ""Realization of dietary intolerance (lactose intolerance)""', ' ""message"": ""Turns out you were just lactose intolerant...""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_984717690463949""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses strong preference for whey protein""', ' ""message"": ""Whey protein IS the best option. Stop lying""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_699159632449489""}', ' {""theme"": ""Critiques the amount of bread and sugar in the product""', ' ""message"": ""No it’s all the bread and suger""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_9499913916755901""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses dissatisfaction with product or service""', ' ""message"": ""It''s not better""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1229886911899844""}', ' {""theme"": ""Indicates lactose intolerance""', ' ""message"": ""This woman is lactose intolerant.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_667622275674347""}', ' {""theme"": ""Advocates for whey as the best option due to being a complete protein""', ' ""message"": ""Dont listen to this rubbish. Whey is the only protein powder available that is a complete protein.\nBeef', ' egg white', ' pea', ' etc all fine but are not complete proteins.\nWhey isolate is best option""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_9498513400214229""}', ' {""theme"": ""Content is not understandable or irrelevant""', ' ""message"": ""ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1700524070561151""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests source of information""', ' ""message"": ""Please provide a source for the information?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"