 nothing and just share bs""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_971195635085017""}', ' {""theme"": ""Recommends hydrolyzed protein as a less bloating alternative to whey isolate""', ' ""message"": ""If whey isolate makes you bloated you can also try hydrolyzed protein which is easier on the stomach.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_537290732754976""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the amount of sugar added""', ' ""message"": ""What''s the deal with the 4grams of sugar added?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_2126664827757332""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests transparency about the ingredients labeled as ''natural flavors''""', ' ""message"": ""Why do you use “natural flavors”. Just tell us what the natural flavors are.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_28964503053164905""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about high price and inaccurate serving size claims""', ' ""message"": ""Tried it and It’s great! Just wish I could afford it! $67 for 1.7 lbs is too high.\n\nOnly 20 servings in a bag not 30 like they state.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_478192525284007""}', ' {""theme"": ""Questions the necessity and amount of ingredients affecting taste""', ' ""message"": ""If it tastes so good why are you putting all that other stuff in there? Also ...how can you know how it tastes with all the stuff you have in there?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_542773601752985""}', ' {""theme"": ""Concern over misleading product claims; states preference for whey due to scientific benefits""', ' ""message"": ""Whey is actually better based on science.  High in leucine and rapid digestion and absorption. Beef is great too', ' but don''t spread lies just to sell your product.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_703020368718054""}'