ng this because bone broth', 'collagen and all the other stuff feeds the virus causing it inflame. Pure meat is ok but not the byproducts. Being a carnivore and having shingles and bone loss puts me beta rock and a hard place. I need the extra protein and it’s hard for me to eat sooo much meat', ' but I’m going to do the extra meat strategy. Shingles are cleared thankfully and I want to keep it like that. I’m only posting in case anyone else has shingles or any herpes virus for that matter. There are 10 types of the virus.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_669604595616191""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes collagen for being ineffective for muscle building""', ' ""message"": ""This is collagen not muscle protein.   Collagen is very poor for building muscle due to lack of necessary essential amino acids.  Collagen is jello without sugar.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1383032996071398""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about low protein content""', ' ""message"": ""Junk protein', ' only 74% protein per serving.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_687351190364253""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes the inclusion of dairy in protein powder""', ' ""message"": ""Dairy does Not belong in protein powder. Dairy has over 25 other hidden names too. \nI use Anthony''s grass-fed.\nDairy kept me sick in many ways.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_678857507977130""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes taste of the product""', ' ""message"": ""If this crap tastes like desert I would hate to taste dinner!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1696261301291817""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about high price compared to whey with less supporting research""', ' ""message"": ""with shipping its 75 dollars for 30 servings😂😂😂😂 3x the price of whey with a fraction of the research😂😂""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""',