oo long in your cup', ' it turns gelatinous.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_987479746452097""}', ' {""theme"": ""Seeks advice on reducing beef taste""', ' ""message"": ""How do I cut down the beef taste? I really want to keep trying this.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1950232222173296""}', ' {""theme"": ""Questions the need for natural flavoring in products""', ' ""message"": ""Why do you need natural flavoring?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_891587679488407""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses daily consumption of the product""', ' ""message"": ""Every day I have mine!!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1525192688097144""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about using the product in overnight oats and how to avoid clumping issues""', ' ""message"": ""Can you use this in making your own overnight oats? How would you avoid the clumps from the naturally occurring collagen and gelatin?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1318831322647735""}', ' {""theme"": ""Mentions competitor pricing and delivery speed advantages""', ' ""message"": ""You can get it the same price or even cheaper on Amazon if you subscribe and it comes in a day!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1396690164346791""}', ' {""theme"": ""Questions about the ingredients used in the product""', ' ""message"": ""What''s with the ingredients 😳""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_463199206335925""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about product compatibility with hot beverages""', ' ""message"": ""Will this dissolve in hot coffee?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1178572759867129""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests for brownie recipe""', ' ""message"": ""Anyone got that brownie recipe""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1448972146083519""}', ' {""theme"": ""Prefers product for better stomach comfort compared to whey or plant protein""', ' ""message"": ""so much better for my stomach then whey or plant protein.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1113662003772494""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about product''s beefy flavor""', ' ""message"": ""Does it have a beefy flavor?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1202570690801336""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the presence of cyanocobalamin in the product ingredients""', ' ""message"": ""Does this contain cyanocobalamin? Looked on the site but wanted to confirm ingredients.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_486607724347689""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about product availability at GNC""', ' ""message"": ""Is this at gnc?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_938783864821247""}', ' {""theme"": ""Mentions regular use or routine involving the product""', ' ""message"": ""Every day.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_502835312531244""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises delicious taste of chocolate Prime Protein but notes clumping issue""', ' ""message"": ""Received my first bag of chocolate Prime Protein today. Absolutely delicious; my only gripe is it gets a bit clumpy (but it warns you on the bag itself', ' so pooh on my opinion lol). Outstanding otherwise!!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1041605538025316""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about excessive sweetness""', ' ""message"": ""Too sweet..  I gagged""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_3814825538795333""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes the health impact and processing of protein powders and BCAAs""', ' ""message"": ""Protein powder\n\nBCAA''s and Protein Powder\n\nFirst', ' no natural \""products\"" or versions of powdered', ' supplemental BCAA''s (branched-chain amino acids) or protein powders exist.\n\nTo make them', ' the proteins and amino acids have to be chemically rendered and heated at least; many are processed much more. \n\nThis process denatures and fragments the proteins and amino acids', ' changing how they are absorbed and the metabolic/hormonal reaction they cause in the body compared to a natural whole-food-sourced protein.\n\nBoth protein powders and BCAA''s dramatically raise insulin compared to natural protein', ' some more than table sugar. \n\nBCAA''s have been associated with insulin resistance and metabolic syndrome directly. And that result was testing natural BCAA''s', ' isolated commercialized versions have a more profound effect still.\n\nDenatured proteins strongly stimulate insulin', ' have an increased Mtor (protein regulation pathway) and incretin (insulin priming) effect', ' and are more easily glycated. \n\nEach of these has independently been shown to turn off our long-lived genes', ' speed up the aging process', ' and promote degenerative diseases. \n\nImagine what happens when all four of those actions are activated at once!\n\nI know the gym lore stating that we have all heard the hype that BCAAs shuttle amino acids into the cells', ' insulin is anabolic and \""builds\"" muscle', ' you need \""X\"" amount of protein to grow', ' etc. \n\nBut when you look at it', ' take a step back. Things are NOT what they seem. \n\nRepair (think gym gains) is very different from growth (think body fat... and worse)', ' and in the big picture', ' these \""techniques\"" might do more harm than good.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1884538021955048""}', ' {""theme"": ""Celebrates a birthday occasion""', ' ""message"": ""So precious!! Happy Birthday!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_864970618910974""}', ' {""theme"": ""Questions the adequacy of protein content per serving""', ' ""message"": ""20 grams of protein isn’t that much. Are y’all drinking a couple a day? I feel like most protein these days is 40-50 grams.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_2451784278359805""}', ' {""theme"": ""Difficulty finding non-allergenic protein powder and excitement to try a new option""', ' ""message"": ""I just ordered one yesterday because I have such a hard time to find protein powder I’m not allergic to . Can’t wait to try it""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_532809249689561""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about high price""', ' ""message"": ""''Expensive""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_647734707964608""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises taste but mentions mixing difficulty""', ' ""message"": ""Best ever . A little hard to mix but tastes fabulous""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1261230765418924""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the product''s meat content""', ' ""message"": ""So is it made from meat?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_546210411487932""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests for a brownie recipe""', ' ""message"": ""I need this brownie recipe! 🤩""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1791284178384541""}', ' {""theme"": ""Uses Equip collagen daily and dislikes Stevia flavor in Prime Protein.""', ' ""message"": ""I use the Equip collagen everyday. I''m still trying to get used to the Prime Protein flavored one but it''s only because I detest Stevia. I do use the unflavored.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_2041914672992310""}', ' {""theme"": ""Frustration with discount code application process""', ' ""message"": ""I went all the way through', ' providing my email and my phone', ' and was in the checkout process. I had copied the discount code', ' but when I pasted it', ' it was the wrong code and now I can’t get back to the correct code. ￼""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1076165153953102""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses dislike for Stevia""', ' ""message"": ""Stevia  🤮""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1597315487639262""}', ' {""theme"": ""Received wrong product flavor and dissatisfied with taste""', ' ""message"": ""Not impressed', ' I ordered chocolate', '  they sent vanilla', '  I put cocoa in it', ' still tastes odd.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1194515635351356""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses strong enthusiasm and satisfaction with the product""', ' ""message"": ""I’m absolutely obsessed with this product!!! #1 hands down!!! ♥️👏🏻""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_962902635181921""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises protein product for bodybuilders""', ' ""message"": ""#1 protein in my book as a hobby bodybuilder!! ❤️""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_535332019233462""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises taste of the product""', ' ""message"": ""Very tasty!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_448176281592888""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asks about histamine content""', ' ""message"": ""Would this be low in histamines ?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1200181305037451""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asks for clarification on source of beef protein ingredients""', ' ""message"": ""When you say beef protein', ' do you mean steak or you also include organs and bones?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1015920990478138""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about where to find recipes""', ' ""message"": ""Where can I get recipes""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_2297157387314208""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests a recipe for brownies""', ' ""message"": ""Do you have a recipe for brownies?￼""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1277213256842840""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises product quality and justifies higher price""', ' ""message"": ""Absolutely love this stuff. I got the coffee from this company and the caramel protein powder and the collagen. I feel like I’m 18 again lol ￼and nuzest it’s also a really good protein powder company. Both companies are pricey but you get a lot for your buck. It’s worth every penny.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_953426639833817""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asks about mixing options for protein powder on Carnivore or Keto diet""', ' ""message"": ""For people doing Carnivore or Keto what are you mixing your protein powder with? Water', ' heavy cream', ' milk', ' etc...""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_3696604367318178""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquiry about availability of flavors without stevia""', ' ""message"": ""How many flavors do you have without stevia?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_3712865409043394""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about compatibility with a strict carnivore diet""', ' ""message"": ""Can this be used with a strict carnivore diet""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_2464451290564164""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about the sweetness of the peanut butter""', ' ""message"": ""I tried the peanut butter and it’s just too sweet. I usually add some additional powdered peanut butter to bump up the peanut flavor.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_9549043048545981""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the availability of product samples""', ' ""message"": ""Do you sell samples?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_8950123735085762""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests recipe for brownies featured in the ad""', ' ""message"": ""Does someone have the recipe for the brownies in the add? It’s not in the recipe book""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_920632043221353""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about high price""', ' ""message"": ""It so expensive""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1539843073380599""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about excess lead content study mentioned""', ' ""message"": ""Are you in the 47% in this recnet study with too much lead? https://www.amazon.com/Cortizone-10-Intensive-Anti-Itch-Hydrocortisone/dp/B0CMVJFWX7?th=1""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_615081784603759""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about product not mixing well""', ' ""message"": ""Just got the unflavored. It doesn’t mix well at all. Remains very clumpy""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1394910418406120""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquiry about mixing options for a product""', ' ""message"": ""What do you mix it with?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_631776299314926""}', ' {""theme"": ""Dissatisfaction with product texture and usability""', ' ""message"": ""I was so excited to try this from all the raving reviews and was dissatisfied. No matter what I did', ' it either clumped', ' got really sticky and was just overall not good. I sold an opened bag and have one that is almost gone. I am forcing myself to use it because I already spent the money.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1682488665992022""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about gluten-free status of the product""', ' ""message"": ""Is it gluten free?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_908881073944807""}', ' {""theme"": ""Customer requests nutritional information on the label for vanilla product""', ' ""message"": ""It won''t let me see the label for vanilla.  I click on it', ' but nothing happens.\nCan you tell me the fat and cholesterol amounts please? Or better yet', ' screenshot the label ?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1749541445823102""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about product not mixing well""', ' ""message"": ""It does not mix well in a shaker cup""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_896081942351216""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asks about product ingredients due to coconut allergy""', ' ""message"": ""Does it have coconut', ' mct oil? I''m allergic to coconut anything.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_4002838600005152""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praised the product for being the best and requested more sugar-free flavors""', ' ""message"": ""🙌🏻 The best & only protein I use! Please create more flavors (definitely without sugar)!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_548381810859306""}', ' {""theme"": ""Seeks clarification on the lead problem related to the product""', ' ""message"": ""I just received mine but didn’t know about the lead problem. Can you explain what this is about?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1015134136875749""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes the health impact and nutritional effectiveness of BCAAs and protein powders""', ' ""message"": ""Protein powder\n\nBCAA''s and Protein Powder\n\nFirst', ' no natural \""products\"" or versions of powdered', ' supplemental BCAA''s (branched-chain amino acids) or protein powders exist.\n\nTo make them', ' the proteins and amino acids have to be chemically rendered and heated at least; many are processed much more. \n\nThis process denatures and fragments the proteins and amino acids', ' changing how they are absorbed and the metabolic/hormonal reaction they cause in the body compared to a natural whole-food-sourced protein.\n\nBoth protein powders and BCAA''s dramatically raise insulin compared to natural protein', ' some more than table sugar. \n\nBCAA''s have been associated with insulin resistance and metabolic syndrome directly. And that result was testing natural BCAA''s', ' isolated commercialized versions have a more profound effect still.\n\nDenatured proteins strongly stimulate insulin', ' have an increased Mtor (protein regulation pathway) and incretin (insulin priming) effect', ' and are more easily glycated. \n\nEach of these has independently been shown to turn off our long-lived genes', ' speed up the aging process', ' and promote degenerative diseases. \n\nImagine what happens when all four of those actions are activated at once!\n\nI know the gym lore stating that we have all heard the hype that BCAAs shuttle amino acids into the cells', ' insulin is anabolic and \""builds\"" muscle', ' you need \""X\"" amount of protein to grow', ' etc. \n\nBut when you look at it', ' take a step back. Things are NOT what they seem. \n\nRepair (think gym gains) is very different from growth (think body fat... and worse)', ' and in the big picture', ' these \""techniques\"" might do more harm than good.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1262166051505761""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests a brownie recipe without peanut butter""', ' ""message"": ""Do you have a brownie recipe without peanut butter???""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_578804928123386""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises chocolate and vanilla flavors', ' highlighting the lack of stevia aftertaste""', ' ""message"": ""This stuff is DELISH!! I’ve always been a chocolate fan and this one truly tastes like chocolate cake. But I tried the vanilla today and OMG! I might like it better than the chocolate. I’ve also always hated the aftertaste with stevia. Not even noticeable in this. I’m hooked.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1564896437469606""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests recipe for Brownies""', ' ""message"": ""Does anyone have the recipe for the Brownies?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_616216924245352""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises product''s effectiveness and taste""', ' ""message"": ""Tried it for the first time my stomach remained flat. The taste was delicious.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_990151416351737""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests removal of synthetic ''natural flavoring'' from products""', ' ""message"": ""Please get rid of “NATURAL FLAVORING”. It’s not natural. It’s synthetic.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1885651398951039""}', ' {""theme"": ""Enjoys adding flavored products and collagen powder to coffee for protein boost""', ' ""message"": ""I love the Salted Caramel', ' Chocolate', ' Vanilla and Peanut Butter. I add a scoop into my cold brew ', ' along with a scoop of your unflavored Collagen Peptide powder. I pulse it in the blender and pour it over ice. Great way to enjoy my coffee and get some protein! Win! Win!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1526910104661897""}', ' {""theme"": ""Excitement about making a purchase""', ' ""message"": ""Just ordered !""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_595393796536335""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests for recipes""', ' ""message"": ""Sure would like some recipes.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1677019662909086""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises taste but highlights issue with clumping""', ' ""message"": ""Tastes great but getting a lot of clumps…. Any suggestions?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1736440733598715""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests recipe for brownies""', ' ""message"": ""Recipe for the brownies?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1774655396603392""}', ' {""theme"": ""Concern about strong beef flavor and smell in unflavored p