ein and unflavored collagen!! Quick and easy.  \n\nI got a free raspberry colostrum gummy bag during a promo you had going', ' and I LOVE those too! \n\nI do wish you had the flavored options without the stevia', ' no sweeteners added at all would be ideal for me. But 100% happy with all products I’ve had so far!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_638712669085100""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises the use of coconut cream for a richer', ' smoother texture in ice cream""', ' ""message"": ""My ice cream recipe:\n2 scoop Equip Prime Protein powder \n(I like strawberry or carmel best)\n1 - 13.5 oz can coconut CREAM\nWater to the FILL LINE of my Largest NutriBullet cup.\nExtract & sweetener to taste. I prefer liquid Allulose or Stevia. \n\nBlend.\n\nPour into Cuisinart ice cream maker and run until thick and creamy ice cream 🍦 😋 \n\nI think the coconut cream makes it even richer and smoother than dairy.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_649051394477502""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about product ingredient', ' casein""', ' ""message"": ""Does it contain casein?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_960552139229223""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes overpowering stevia aftertaste""', ' ""message"": ""The thought the stevia aftertaste was overpowering.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_517208234702133""}', ' {""theme"": ""Asks about product manufacturing location""', ' ""message"": ""Where is it MANUFACTURED?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1035105398650141""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about presence of stevia in many protein powders""', ' ""message"": ""I’m allergic to stevia and it’s in sooooo many protein powders:(""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_526141710012706""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about availability of sample sizes""', ' ""message"": ""Do you have sample sizes to try?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_2534784773539775""}', ' {""theme"": ""Request to exchange chocolate flavor for vanilla""', ' ""message"": ""I''ve tried 2 times to like the chocolate bc it is so clean. I just can''t make it work for me. Can I swap it for vanilla or am I SOL?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1188242286053660""}', ' {""theme"": ""Anticipates trying Maria Emmerich recommended product with satisfaction guarantee""', ' ""message"": ""I ordered this one chocolate one vanilla  Keto Adapted - Maria Emmerich recommended  them hope they are good im glad there is a guarantee  i will post update after I receive and use some""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_528225803059261""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests removal of natural flavors for health reasons""', ' ""message"": ""Got natural flavors in this one also I think everyone that I look at it got natural flavors. Take the natural flavors out and I will probably get it. It’s not good for your gut. Thank you. Have a blessed day.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1036458011192073""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests the recipe details for a chocolate peanut butter creation shown in a video""', ' ""message"": ""I want to know the recipe for the chocolate peanut butter creation in the pan in the video""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_507864592206175""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about product taste""', ' ""message"": ""I purchased this and after using just once I stopped. To ME it tasted so disgusting. Wish I had liked it.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_675453315166051""}', ' {""theme"": ""Appreciates equipment for blending and baking', ' but finds it unsatisfactory for shaking with water""', ' ""message"": ""Love love love equip . Blended.l and baking . Not so good shaken with water . Pretty chunky .""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1386352942493446""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about specific beef ingredients and sourcing information""', ' ""message"": ""Can someone provide a link to the exact ingredients. What part of the cow is it made from? Where is it sourced? I googled but it just says beef based. \nThanks""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1573069409997160""}', ' {""theme"": ""Likes the taste in Greek yogurt but finds it hard to mix in a blender bottle""', ' ""message"": ""It’s truly the best but so hard to shake up in a blender bottle. It’s delicious mixed with some Greek yogurt though 👌🏻""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_488857747103643""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises the taste of strawberry""', ' ""message"": ""Strawberry is delicious!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_362636130250579""}', ' {""theme"": ""Comment on delicious appearance and high price""', ' ""message"": ""Looks delicious and all but a little bit on the pricey side .""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1439063850599121""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about mixing issues and bitter flavor; notes better stomach tolerance""', ' ""message"": ""Doesn''t mix well even in shaker bottles. Foams up alot and has very strong bitter flavor. That being said it''s a lot friendlier on the stomach than most whey. Used the unflavored one. Just stays clumped""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1084558872867232""}', ' {""theme"": ""Promotes eating natural or whole foods""', ' ""message"": ""Eat real food""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_542590322187392""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses satisfaction with the product received""', ' ""message"": ""Just got my bag today and really like it!!!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""