red and heated at least; many are processed much more. \n\nThis process denatures and fragments the proteins and amino acids', ' changing how they are absorbed and the metabolic/hormonal reaction they cause in the body compared to a natural whole-food-sourced protein.\n\nBoth protein powders and BCAA''s dramatically raise insulin compared to natural protein', ' some more than table sugar. \n\nBCAA''s have been associated with insulin resistance and metabolic syndrome directly. And that result was testing natural BCAA''s', ' isolated commercialized versions have a more profound effect still.\n\nDenatured proteins strongly stimulate insulin', ' have an increased Mtor (protein regulation pathway) and incretin (insulin priming) effect', ' and are more easily glycated. \n\nEach of these has independently been shown to turn off our long-lived genes', ' speed up the aging process', ' and promote degenerative diseases. \n\nImagine what happens when all four of those actions are activated at once!\n\nI know the gym lore stating that we have all heard the hype that BCAAs shuttle amino acids into the cells', ' insulin is anabolic and \""builds\"" muscle', ' you need \""X\"" amount of protein to grow', ' etc. \n\nBut when you look at it', ' take a step back. Things are NOT what they seem. \n\nRepair (think gym gains) is very different from growth (think body fat... and worse)', ' and in the big picture', ' these \""techniques\"" might do more harm than good.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1262166051505761""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-01-25T21:35:37.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests a brownie recipe without peanut butter""', ' ""message"": ""Do you have a brownie recipe without peanut butter???""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_578804928123386""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-01-02T20:53:40.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises chocolate and vanilla flavors', ' highlighting the lack of stevia aftertaste""', ' ""message"": ""This stuff is DELISH!! I’ve always been a chocolate fan and this one truly tastes like chocolate cake. But I tried the vanilla today and OMG! I might like it better than the chocolate. I’ve also always hated the aftertaste with stevia. Not even noticeable in this. I’m hooked.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1564896437469606""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-09-27T20:55:35.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests recipe for Brownies""', ' ""message"": ""Does anyone have the recipe for the Brownies?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_616216924245352""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-12-11T21:06:02.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises product''s effectiveness and taste""', ' ""message"": ""Tried it for the first time my stomach remained flat. The taste was delicious.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_990151416351737""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-01-25T19:05:20.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests removal of synthetic ''natural flavoring'' from products""', ' ""message"": ""Please get rid of “NATURAL FLAVORING”. It’s not natural. It’s synthetic.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1885651398951039""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-03-12T18:41:55.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Enjoys adding flavored products and collagen powder to coffee for protein boost""', ' ""message"": ""I love the Salted Caramel', ' Chocolate', ' Vanilla and Peanut Butter. I add a scoop into my cold brew ', ' along with a scoop of your unflavored Collagen Peptide powder. I pulse it in the blender and pour it over ice. Great way to enjoy my coffee and get some protein! Win! Win!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1526910104661897""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-02-13T20:02:03.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Excitement about making a purchase""', ' ""message"": ""Just ordered !""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""com