ement""', ' ""message"": ""Telllll’em sis! ❤️""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1348148649333563""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-10-12T14:37:09.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about high histamine content due to health concerns""', ' ""message"": ""Would you say the histamine content of this would be very high. Curious because I have mast cell issues""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1825837491274194""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-08-03T19:18:53.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about health benefits and specific effects on digestion and appearance""', ' ""message"": ""So what is the main reason to take this for your health? What does it do for you like does it help you go to the bathroom? Is it good for your hair', ' skin and nails so one so far?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_920001640052342""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-11-05T14:30:07.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises product effectiveness and convenience compared to meat protein""', ' ""message"": ""This is the best chocolate protein powder I’ve ever tried plus the added benefit of losing 10 pounds in a week! Thanks for offering this great product! It’s much easier than trying to consume the amount of meat protein I need in a day♥️✨""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_562949376804144""', ' ""created_time"": ""2025-03-23T13:16:30.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the source and processing of beef""', ' ""message"": ""What''s the processing of the beef? Is it from bonebroth?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_987758273139537""', ' ""created_time"": ""2024-08-01T19:24:11.000Z""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises product appearance and visual appeal of brownies""', ' ""message"": ""Love it! And those brownies look delicious""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1212094463435074""', ' ""crea