ounts', ' so i winged it.   It was so mushy with the sweet potatoes.  Although I did not have the powdered collagen', ' so maybe that made a difference.  Also I used a different nut butter than almond because I try to stay away from almond butter. It did not have structure and turned out more like pudding.  The taste was yummy though.  Also I used allulose instead of maple syrup.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1006715324721757""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about misleading claims regarding being grassfed and questions product quality""', ' ""message"": ""NOT GRASSFED FINISHED', ' YOUR FUKED UP THINK PEOPLE ARE STUPID', 'KEED SAYING GRASSED LITTLE BOY', 'NOT EVEN ORGANIC', 'NON GMO????\nHOW MANY TIMES  YOU HAVE TO SAY GRASSFED..1/2 TRUTH""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1248296563530879""}', ' {""theme"": ""Dismisses health concerns over product ingredients""', ' ""message"": ""Looks yummy - I don''t think one brownie is going to kill your system. Carbs', ' isolates', ' oh my - if it scares you', ' don''t eat it!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1338152137464143""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the type of sweetener used in the product""', ' ""message"": ""What is it sweetened with?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1006197427618521""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about sample availability""', ' ""message"": ""Do you offer samples""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_1188323129287582""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about sales or discounts""', ' ""message"": ""Do you guys do sales or discounts ever?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1447462756669424_640484125476649""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses engagement or excitement about using the product""', ' ""message"": ""I just made this on sunday!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""144746275