 nothing and just share bs""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_971195635085017""}', ' {""theme"": ""Recommends hydrolyzed protein as a less bloating alternative to whey isolate""', ' ""message"": ""If whey isolate makes you bloated you can also try hydrolyzed protein which is easier on the stomach.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_537290732754976""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the amount of sugar added""', ' ""message"": ""What''s the deal with the 4grams of sugar added?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_2126664827757332""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests transparency about the ingredients labeled as ''natural flavors''""', ' ""message"": ""Why do you use “natural flavors”. Just tell us what the natural flavors are.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_28964503053164905""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about high price and inaccurate serving size claims""', ' ""message"": ""Tried it and It’s great! Just wish I could afford it! $67 for 1.7 lbs is too high.\n\nOnly 20 servings in a bag not 30 like they state.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_478192525284007""}', ' {""theme"": ""Questions the necessity and amount of ingredients affecting taste""', ' ""message"": ""If it tastes so good why are you putting all that other stuff in there? Also ...how can you know how it tastes with all the stuff you have in there?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_542773601752985""}', ' {""theme"": ""Concern over misleading product claims; states preference for whey due to scientific benefits""', ' ""message"": ""Whey is actually better based on science.  High in leucine and rapid digestion and absorption. Beef is great too', ' but don''t spread lies just to sell your product.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_703020368718054""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises nutritional value of hot beef injections""', ' ""message"": ""Hot beef injections are very nutritious""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_984794250387131""}', ' {""theme"": ""Discusses the benefits of whey protein isolate for those who cannot tolerate meat proteins""', ' ""message"": ""Of dairy products whey protein isolate is the most readily absorbed.  Because believe it or not there are those of us that do not tolerate meat proteins.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_2853624998151199""}', ' {""theme"": ""Dislikes the use of stevia in the product""', ' ""message"": ""You had me until I saw stevia.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_2123713838081797""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes use of stevia in product""', ' ""message"": ""Wish it didn’t use stevia""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1186551653017279""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes product quality""', ' ""message"": ""Because you had poor quality whey.... bullshit post.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_2808219529360784""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticism of claims made by influential bodybuilders""', ' ""message"": ""Interesting how all the big bodybuilders with proven results will disagree.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_1208290910857433""}', ' {""theme"": ""Expresses a dismissive or negative reaction""', ' ""message"": ""Shut up.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1451051246310575_688550123608948""}', ' {""theme"": ""Concerns about bone broth and collagen impacting shingles condition""', ' ""message"": ""I was curious about isolates so I looked it up. All the fat and some other stuff has been removed but I discovered that the bone is used along with other stuff. I was hoping it was fully meat. Having reoccurring shingles prevents me from usi