about excessive sweetness""', ' ""message"": ""Too sweet..  I gagged""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_3814825538795333""}', ' {""theme"": ""Criticizes the health impact and processing of protein powders and BCAAs""', ' ""message"": ""Protein powder\n\nBCAA''s and Protein Powder\n\nFirst', ' no natural \""products\"" or versions of powdered', ' supplemental BCAA''s (branched-chain amino acids) or protein powders exist.\n\nTo make them', ' the proteins and amino acids have to be chemically rendered and heated at least; many are processed much more. \n\nThis process denatures and fragments the proteins and amino acids', ' changing how they are absorbed and the metabolic/hormonal reaction they cause in the body compared to a natural whole-food-sourced protein.\n\nBoth protein powders and BCAA''s dramatically raise insulin compared to natural protein', ' some more than table sugar. \n\nBCAA''s have been associated with insulin resistance and metabolic syndrome directly. And that result was testing natural BCAA''s', ' isolated commercialized versions have a more profound effect still.\n\nDenatured proteins strongly stimulate insulin', ' have an increased Mtor (protein regulation pathway) and incretin (insulin priming) effect', ' and are more easily glycated. \n\nEach of these has independently been shown to turn off our long-lived genes', ' speed up the aging process', ' and promote degenerative diseases. \n\nImagine what happens when all four of those actions are activated at once!\n\nI know the gym lore stating that we have all heard the hype that BCAAs shuttle amino acids into the cells', ' insulin is anabolic and \""builds\"" muscle', ' you need \""X\"" amount of protein to grow', ' etc. \n\nBut when you look at it', ' take a step back. Things are NOT what they seem. \n\nRepair (think gym gains) is very different from growth (think body fat... and worse)', ' and in the big picture', ' these \""techniques\"" might do more harm than good.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1884538021955048""}', ' {""theme"": ""Celebrates a birthday occasion""', ' ""message"": ""So precious!! Happy Birthday!""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_864970618910974""}', ' {""theme"": ""Questions the adequacy of protein content per serving""', ' ""message"": ""20 grams of protein isn’t that much. Are y’all drinking a couple a day? I feel like most protein these days is 40-50 grams.""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_2451784278359805""}', ' {""theme"": ""Difficulty finding non-allergenic protein powder and excitement to try a new option""', ' ""message"": ""I just ordered one yesterday because I have such a hard time to find protein powder I’m not allergic to . Can’t wait to try it""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_532809249689561""}', ' {""theme"": ""Complains about high price""', ' ""message"": ""''Expensive""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Negative""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_647734707964608""}', ' {""theme"": ""Praises taste but mentions mixing difficulty""', ' ""message"": ""Best ever . A little hard to mix but tastes fabulous""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1261230765418924""}', ' {""theme"": ""Inquires about the product''s meat content""', ' ""message"": ""So is it made from meat?""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Neutral""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_546210411487932""}', ' {""theme"": ""Requests for a brownie recipe""', ' ""message"": ""I need this brownie recipe! 🤩""', ' ""sentiment"": ""Positive""', ' ""comment_id"": ""1212421336840235_1791284178384541""}', ' {""theme"": ""Uses Equip collagen daily and dislikes Stevia flavor in Prime Protein.""', ' ""message"": ""I use the Equip collagen everyday. I''m still trying to get used to the Prime Protein flavored one but it''s only because I detest Stevia. I do use the un